Tests 
=====
- Small displacement Bbar 3D element
- Elastoplastic J2 3D constitutive model

Geometry
========
1 cube, 8 nodes

Conditions
==========
Displacement, constrainted in Z to compare with 2D plane strain state.

Notes
=====
Convergence should be quadratic

